  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Menstrual items &amp; Awareness for 200 village girls</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In our villages, women and girls are STILL using old rags, causing infections &amp;  disease. Besides this during their monthly cycles women are considered impure and it is for these reasons that many girls are forgoing school. Sanitary Pads &amp; items of hygiene are equally expensive and they&apos;d rather buy food. So by this Menstrual Hygiene day, we plan to provide 200 girls in 5 different schools with Sanitary pads, dustbins and soaps for maintaining menstrual hygiene followed by Awareness classes!</narrative>
  </description>
